          "@value": "hand-over-credential"
        }
      ],
      "skos:definition": [
        {
          "@value": "The health worker at the issuing side hands the holder the credentials the issuing system made: printed (one QR per certificate) or into the holder's wallet, and says what each is. Input is what was issued and the medium; output is what the holder now holds. Performed by a person; the issuing system's own steps are the hcert package's."
        }
      ],
      "skos:notation": "hand-over-credential",
      "dcterms:source": "smart-trust-tools/skills/wallet/hand-over-credential.md",
